[h2]Build 0.9.14[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]The Builder power suit: a lightly armoured work suit that builds and smooths much faster and carries more.
[*]Builder construction drill arm: a construction drill with a nail gun alongside. The drill speeds up building (two arms faster still); the nail gun is the pilot's weapon, a short-range rapid-fire gun (two arms fire as twin nail guns).
[/list]
